    {
      "id": "source-conflicts",
      "label": "来源冲突与采用依据",
      "value": [
        "Overview saysFT6146; same official resource page linksFT3168 PDF and exact BSP usesFT3168 driver. Only the sourced compatible touch report is implemented; noFT6146 chip ID is fabricated.",
        "Physical BOOT9 is used; copied BSP_BUTTONS_IO_0=GPIO0 is not rebound as a button becauseGPIO0 is the battery ADC network.",
        "Native STEP contains both header rows: bareSKU34055 omits only topology1/2; preheaderSKU34056 retains all264. Viewing22.34×36.06 and native emissive21.84×35.57 mm remain distinct."
      ],
