        "limitations": [
          "Native CAD is a manufacturer mechanical export, not an electrical schematic or production-revision guarantee.",
          "No hardware-fit or browser WebGL acceptance claim. Unspecified CAD material uses a stated fallback, never a fabricated silkscreen or texture.",
          "Live framebuffer is projected onto the native front viewing face; this rendering offset is not glass thickness.",
          "The retained native assembly includes both presoldered rows; bare SKU34055 omits only native topologies1 and2. SKU34056-M retains all264 components.",
          "The dimension image states22.34×36.06 mm viewing aperture. Framebuffer uses the independently extracted21.84×35.57 mm emissive rectangle, projected through that cover; the two dimensions are not conflated.",
